    Settings homepage tile icon — Xiaomi Parts.

    Design: crossed wrench (↘) and screwdriver (↙) forming an X,
    central pivot circle, three grip dots on the wrench shaft,
    corner bracket accent top-right. Matches the reference artwork.

    LayerDrawable: Monet primaryColor circle + white icon centred inside.
    Rendered as a single filled path with fillType evenOdd so the pivot
    hole and grip dots punch through at every rendered size.
-->
