                  D1 — grip dot on wrench shaft upper segment    [punched hole]
                  D2 — grip dot on wrench shaft mid segment      [punched hole]
                  D3 — grip dot on wrench shaft lower segment    [punched hole]
                  WH — wrench head fork, top-left corner
                  SH — screwdriver flat-head tip, bottom-right corner
